  "notes": "FORMS:\nうたた{寝|ね}する (to doze off)\n\nWRITING:\nThe word can also be written as {転寝|うたたね}, though hiragana is more common.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {居眠|いねむ}り (dozing while sitting, especially at work or in class)\n- ひと{眠|ねむ}り (a short nap, intentional)\n- {昼寝|ひるね} (afternoon nap)\n\nUSAGE:\nうたた{寝|ね} implies falling asleep unintentionally and briefly, often in a place not meant for sleeping.",
